  "summary": "A style of painting that combines realistic depiction with dreamlike or fantastical elements.",
  "description": "Characterized by precise, realistic rendering of ordinary subject matter infused with magical or supernatural elements, Magic Realism created a sense of the uncanny within everyday scenes. It emerged as a reaction against Expressionism and Dada, seeking a return to craftsmanship while incorporating mysterious elements. The style often depicted ordinary objects in extraordinary contexts or with impossible qualities.",
