  "visualDNA": {
    "Overview": "The term magic realism is broadly descriptive rather than critically rigorous.\" The term and its wide definition can often become confused, as many writers are categorized as magical realists. The term was influenced by a German and Italian painting style of the 1920s, which was given the same name."
